OL,3,GNEWSAMurder probe after man dies in
OL,4,A'targeted' attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation has been
OL,7,Flaunched after a man was fatally
OL,8,Fattacked by a group of people armed
OL,9,Fwith weapons in Leeds.
OL,11,FThe 38-year-old victim was attacked
OL,12,Foutside a property in New Wortley at
OL,13,Fabout 22:25 BST on Saturday in what
OL,14,Fpolice described as a "targeted and
OL,15,Fisolated" incident.
OL,17,FPolice and paramedics attended the
OL,18,Faddress on Hedley Chase and gave the
OL,19,Fman treatment, but he was pronounced
OL,20,Fdead a short time later.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
