OL,3,GNEWSAMurder probe after man dies in
OL,4,A'targeted' attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FDet Ch Insp Dan Bates, of West
OL,7,FYorkshire Police's homicide and major
OL,8,Fenquiry team, said the force was
OL,9,Fworking "extremely hard" to identify
OL,10,Fthose involved.
